02:11.986 --> 02:20.453
and true I'll always share the flight

02:20.533 --> 02:21.514
path with you.

02:35.646 --> 02:39.649
The navel clock is ticking in my head.

02:42.622 --> 02:49.408
We take the leverage, nothing left unsaid. An

02:49.508 --> 02:53.151
